  "remarks": "LLC “Ecoprom” is a Russian company which manufactures first person view (FPV) unmanned aerial vehicles (UAVs) of Bekas series, including models Bekas-700, Bekas-2500, Bekas-3500, Bekas-4500. All these UAVs are used in Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine. LLC “Ecoprom” also manufactures special kits for its UAVs of Bekas series.",
